PHP pagination in a clinic dashboard: the important boundary is clear. Use a bounded integer page and limit, calculate offset, and run a separate COUNT query; do not interpolate arbitrary request values into SQL.

Relevant example:
```text
$page = max(1, min((int)($_GET['page'] ?? 1), 10000));
$limit = 25;
$statement = $pdo->prepare('SELECT id, title FROM posts ORDER BY created_at DESC LIMIT :limit OFFSET :offset');
$statement->bindValue(':limit', $limit, PDO::PARAM_INT);
$statement->bindValue(':offset', ($page - 1) * $limit, PDO::PARAM_INT);
$statement->execute();
```

