AI API integration in a course platform: the important boundary is clear. Keep the provider key server-side, set timeouts and retry limits, validate model output before use, and log request metadata without sensitive prompt content.

Relevant example:
```text
$payload = json_decode(file_get_contents('php://input'), true, 512, JSON_THROW_ON_ERROR);
if (!is_string($payload['email'] ?? null) || !filter_var($payload['email'], FILTER_VALIDATE_EMAIL)) {
    http_response_code(422);
    echo json_encode(['error' => 'A valid email is required']);
